  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the trenched monuments of old Solana, 'Rusty' scraped by as a scavenger, haunted by the crimson stains he could never wash from his feathers. The Clan Talonborn beads he wears are a constant reminder of debts unpaid and loyalties tested in the DRIP wars.",
    "class": "Trench Raider",
    "name": "Rusty 'Dust Devil' Mallard",
    "personality": "Gritty and cynical, Rusty has seen too much to trust anyone easily. Despite his rough exterior, he possesses a fiercely protective streak for those few he considers his flock. Beneath the dust and grime lies a surprisingly sharp tactical mind, honed from years of navigating the treacherous trenches.",
